---
// Pulse mockup: the curated home screen — briefing / action / reminder.
---

<div class="flex h-full flex-col px-4 pt-14 pb-6">
  <div class="display text-[21px] font-bold text-white">good morning.</div>
  <div class="text-[11.5px] text-white/50">Tuesday · 3 things worth your attention</div>

  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[12px]">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#8b5cf6]/40 bg-[#3b1a78]/45 p-3.5">
      <div class="text-[9.5px] font-bold tracking-widest text-[#c9b8ff] uppercase">Briefing</div>
      <div class="mt-1 font-semibold text-white">Your day, ahead of you</div>
      <div class="mt-0.5 text-white/65">3 meetings, gap at 2pm. Rain from 4 — leave early for the station.</div>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#c9b8ff]">Read now →</div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-400/35 bg-rose-500/12 p-3.5">
      <div class="text-[9.5px] font-bold tracking-widest text-rose-300 uppercase">Action</div>
      <div class="mt-1 font-semibold text-white">Deposit form due today</div>
      <div class="mt-0.5 text-white/65">Jonas replied overnight. Your answer is drafted.</div>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-rose-300">Reply now →</div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3.5">
      <div class="text-[9.5px] font-bold tracking-widest text-amber-200 uppercase">Reminder</div>
      <div class="mt-1 font-semibold text-white">Mum's birthday Friday</div>
      <div class="mt-0.5 text-white/65">Flowers to her office? Last year's florist delivers next-day.</div>
      <div class="mt-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-200">View →</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-auto pt-3 text-center text-[10.5px] text-white/40">
    Osmos only pings you when it matters.
  </div>
</div>
